{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/5a1cbe0dbf4600f925dfbb1cb42112b2.poster.avif?t=1773424730\" width=770 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/5a1cbe0dbf4600f925dfbb1cb42112b2.webm?t=1773424730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/5a1cbe0dbf4600f925dfbb1cb42112b2.mp4?t=1773424730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morphos is a psychological horror/adventure game in which you play as a man who has recently been discharged from a psychiatric hospital after losing his memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon returning home, your wife, a research scientist, out of compassion and a desire to keep an eye on you, arranges for you to join her team. Your workplace turns out to be a gloomy and mysterious underground complex where experiments with anomalous phenomena are conducted.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/a74303d6c12fa4d8ccb99a4c4cada74f.poster.avif?t=1773424730\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/a74303d6c12fa4d8ccb99a4c4cada74f.webm?t=1773424730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, everything seems like an attempt to return to normal life, but soon strange things begin to happen underground</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/64da659eda2d4108d8315c6863822af4.poster.avif?t=1773424730\" width=770 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/64da659eda2d4108d8315c6863822af4.webm?t=1773424730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/64da659eda2d4108d8315c6863822af4.mp4?t=1773424730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of a gloomy underground complex</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solving numerous puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic dialogue with response choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shifting level geometry (mazes, spatial distortions)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden jump scares and sudden frightening events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various types of environmental traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters with monsters and anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapon types for self-defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding keys and artifacts for progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final boss battle with a highly dangerous boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management (health, ammo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save system in safe rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporal anomalies affecting gameplay<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/f250dfcf9e91b9d7461bb1536455ba74.poster.avif?t=1773424730\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/f250dfcf9e91b9d7461bb1536455ba74.webm?t=1773424730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:/